@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = PASTE_YOUR_JWT_HERE

### Register - Create new account
POST http://localhost:5080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Test",
    "lastName": "User",
    "email": "testuser@example.com",
    "password": "BookNook123!"
}

### Login - Valid Credentials
POST http://localhost:5080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "testuser@example.com",
    "password": "BookNook123!"
}

### Login - Invalid Password
POST http://localhost:5080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword123!"
}

### Protected Endpoint - No Token
GET http://localhost:5080/api/testauth

### Protected Endpoint - Invalid Token
GET http://localhost:5080/api/testauth
Authorization: Bearer invalid.token.value

### Protected Endpoint - Valid Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/testauth
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
